# Raw firmware console captures fed to tools/fading_from_logs.py. Multi-hour logs
# from several nodes get large, so they stay out of git by default. ⚠ If you want
# a specific capture kept as reference measurement data, un-ignore it explicitly
# (e.g. `!dumps/2026-07-25-fading-reference/`) rather than dropping this rule.
dumps/

